   360	// Queued follow-ups are drained by Pi's internal agent loop, outside any
   361	// AsyncLocalStorage scope, so the submitting run's auth context would be lost.
   362	// We capture it per queued message here and re-activate it when Pi starts
   363	// processing that message (message_start), keyed weakly on the message object.
   364	function rememberQueuedFollowUpRunContexts(
